<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="37.2" level="1">Behavioral Health and Developmental Services</unit>
		<unit label="subtitle" identifier="II" level="2">Behavioral Health and Developmental Services</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="6" level="3">Behavioral Health Authorities</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>37.2-607</section_number>
	<catch_line>Background check required</catch_line>
	<text>
		A behavioral health authority shall fulfill the duties of and be subject to the employee background check requirements that are applicable to community services boards, as set forth in §§ 37.2-506 and 37.2-506.1.
	</text>
	<history>1997, c. 743, § 37.1-197.2; 1998, cc. 130, 680, 882; 1999, c. 685; 2001, c. 784; 2002, c. 712; 2003, c. 468; 2005, c. 716; 2023, c. 236.</history>
</law>
